
---
import DocsLayout from "../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<DocsLayout
	title="Installation"
	description="Learn how to install Loot Containers in Minecraft."
>
	<div class="info-box">
		<strong>Before you begin</strong>
		<p>
			Loot Containers currently targets Minecraft Java Edition 1.20.1
			and Minecraft Forge 47.4.28.
		</p>
	</div>

	<h2>Requirements</h2>

	<div class="requirement-grid">
		<div class="requirement-card">
			<span class="requirement-label">GAME</span>
			<strong>Minecraft Java Edition</strong>
			<span>Version 1.20.1</span>
		</div>

		<div class="requirement-card">
			<span class="requirement-label">MOD LOADER</span>
			<strong>Minecraft Forge</strong>
			<span>47.4.28</span>
		</div>
	</div>

	<h2>Step 1 — Install Minecraft Forge</h2>
	<p>
		Download and install the Forge version required by Loot Containers.
		Make sure you select Minecraft 1.20.1.
	</p>

	<a
        class="external-link"
        href="https://www.curseforge.com/download/app"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
        View Curseforge App ↗
    </a>

	<h2>Step 2 — Download Loot Containers</h2>
    <p>
        Visit the official Loot Containers CurseForge page to download the mod.
        Downloads will be available once the mod finishes review.
    </p>

    <a
        class="external-link"
        href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-containers/preview"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
        Visit Loot Containers on CurseForge ↗
    </a>

    <div class="info-box">
        <strong>Manual installation only</strong>
        <p>
            The following steps are for users installing Loot Containers
            manually. If you're using the CurseForge app, you can skip
            Steps 3–5 and install the mod through the app instead.
        </p>
    </div>

	<h2>Step 3 — Locate your mods folder</h2>
	<p>
		Open your Minecraft installation directory and locate the
		<code>mods</code> folder.
	</p>

	<div class="code-panel">
		<span class="code-label">WINDOWS</span>
		<code>%appdata%\.minecraft\mods</code>
	</div>

	<p>
		If the folder doesn't exist, create a new folder named
		<code>mods</code>.
	</p>

	<h2>Step 4 — Install the mod</h2>
	<p>
		Move the downloaded Loot Containers JAR file into your
		<code>mods</code> folder.
	</p>

	<h2>Step 5 — Launch Minecraft</h2>
	<p>
		Open the Minecraft Launcher and select your Forge 1.20.1
		installation. Start the game and check the Mods menu to
		confirm Loot Containers is loaded.
	</p>

	<div class="success-box">
		<strong>Installation complete!</strong>
		<p>
			You're ready to start exploring Loot Containers.
			Continue to the Getting Started guide to learn about
			the mod's configuration and features.
		</p>
		<a href={`${base}docs/getting-started/`}>Read Getting Started →</a>
	</div>

	<div class="page-navigation">
		<a href={`${base}docs/getting-started/`}>← Introduction</a>
		<a href={`${base}docs/loot-tables/`}>Next: Loot Tables →</a>
	</div>
</DocsLayout>

<style>
	h2 {
		margin: 38px 0 12px;
		color: #eee8ff;
		font-size: 21px;
	}

	p {
		color: #aaa5bb;
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	code {
		padding: 3px 7px;
		border-radius: 6px;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
		color: #b9dfff;
		font-size: 12px;
	}

	.info-box, .success-box {
		padding: 19px;
		margin: 20px 0;
		border: 1px solid rgba(139,220,255,.2);
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: rgba(139,220,255,.055);
	}

	.info-box strong, .success-box strong {
		color: #b9dfff;
		font-size: 14px;
	}

	.info-box p, .success-box p {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.requirement-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 13px;
		margin: 20px 0;
	}

	.requirement-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 19px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
		border-radius: 14px;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,.035);
	}

	.requirement-label, .code-label {
		color: #c49ff3;
		font-size: 9px;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 1.5px;
	}

	.requirement-card strong {
		color: #eee8ff;
		font-size: 14px;
	}

	.requirement-card > span:last-child {
		color: #aaa5bb;
		font-size: 12px;
	}

	.external-link {
		display: inline-block;
		margin: 5px 0;
		color: #a9dfff;
		font-size: 13px;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.external-link:hover {
		color: #f3a6e8;
	}

	.code-panel {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 12px;
		padding: 17px;
		margin: 15px 0;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: rgba(0,0,0,.22);
	}

	.success-box {
		margin-top: 35px;
		border-color: rgba(243,166,232,.25);
		background: linear-gradient(110deg, rgba(139,220,255,.07), rgba(243,166,232,.07));
	}

	.success-box strong {
		color: #e8b5ed;
	}

	.success-box a {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 12px;
		color: #b9dfff;
		font-size: 13px;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.page-navigation {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 15px;
		margin-top: 40px;
		padding-top: 22px;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09);
	}

	.page-navigation a {
		color: #b9dfff;
		font-size: 12px;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.page-navigation a:hover {
		color: #f3a6e8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 550px) {
		.requirement-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
